        "2. On catching `OpenAIAPIError` (or generic `Exception` indicating a 405), log a warning and instantiate `HuggingFaceEmbeddings` instead.",
        "3. Make the choice configurable via an environment variable `EMBEDDING_BACKEND` (values: `openai`, `huggingface`). Default to `openai` for backward compatibility.",
        "4. Remove the duplicated `from langchain.embeddings.openai import OpenAIEmbeddings` inside the loop; import once at top.",
        "5. Update the code to call `create_embeddings()` before building the Chroma vectorstore.",
